body+='<section class="newsletter section-pad"><div>'+label('STAY IN OUR RHYTHM','STAY IN OUR RHYTHM')+title('让舒适，继续发生。','Stay in our rhythm.')+bi('p','产品资讯、体验邀请与品牌近况，期待与你分享。','Product news, experience invitations and little updates from RHYVIA.')+'</div><div class="newsletter-upcoming">'+bi('p','邮件订阅即将开放','Email updates are coming soon')+bi('span','你可以先通过上方渠道了解体验安排。','Explore the contact options above to plan your experience.')+'</div></section>'
